2617851850,"text":"つまり、ちゃんと探せばきっと大儲けでき…","nextNodeIds":[110210215]},{"nodeId":110210215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":2731890370,"text":"コホン、収穫はあるってことだな？それなら安心だ。","nextNodeIds":[110210216]},{"nodeId":110210216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1066418874,"text":"この人数なら、手分けして探した方がいいだろう。","nextNodeIds":[110210217]},{"nodeId":110210217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3283177266,"text":"ああ、では俺は友人と共に行くことにする。雑学は分かるが、プロの考古学者の前で恥をかくのは遠慮したいからな。","nextNodeIds":[110210218]},{"nodeId":110210218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":2293256794,"text":"えっ？ア、アタシ？","nextNodeIds":[110210219]},{"nodeId":110210219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":668081434,"text":"なんだ？あんたの本職だろ、なぜ驚く？","nextNodeIds":[110210220]},{"nodeId":110210220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":152628138,"text":"分かったわ…で、では案内するわ。","nextNodeIds":[110210221]},{"nodeId":110210221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3071319506,"text":"ああ、珍しいものを見つけたら、そうだな…対岸で落ち合おう。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102102,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["10232"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":1102107,"order":3,"stepDescription":"「元素視角」を使って古物を探す","stepDescTextMapHash":2248107860,"finishConds":[{"B