NodeIds":[110210609]},{"nodeId":110210609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":2862223922,"text":"そっちこそ、モラのことしか聞いてこなかったじゃない！貴重な文化財の価値をモラで測ることしか知らないの！","nextNodeIds":[110210610]},{"nodeId":110210610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1203652282,"text":"そ、それは…モラで言えば一番分かりやすいだろ！まさに璃月の伝統だ！","nextNodeIds":[110210611]},{"nodeId":110210611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1108587418,"text":"二人とも少し落ち着け。お互い見つけた物を一緒に確認しよう。","nextNodeIds":[110210612]},{"nodeId":110210612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1630699610,"text":"ふむ…","nextNodeIds":[110210613]},{"nodeId":110210613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2762277594,"text":"そちらが見つけた物は確かに「渦の魔神」の影響で岸に上がったものだが、魔神とは関係がないな。残念だが、この海域に元々あったものだ。","nextNodeIds":[110210614]},{"nodeId":110210614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":581767130,"text":"一方、俺たちが見つけた石板には不思議な模様がある、魔神の力も残っているな。研究に役立つと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110210615]},{"nodeId":110210615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":299327490,"text":"は、早くそれを俺に渡せ！","nextNodeIds":[110210616]},{"nodeId":110210616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1168564138,"text":"へヘッ、これで収穫はありだな。魔神の力、これを探してたんだ…","nextNodeIds":[110210617]},{"nodeId":110210617,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1612883506,"text":"コホン、他のものも少しは金になると思うし、顧問料を回収できるはずだ——全部、俺のものだからな！","nextNodeIds":[110210618]},{"nodeId":110210618,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2076002002,"text":"魔神の力がないと、研究価値がないのか？","nextNodeIds":[110210619]},{"nodeId":110210619,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":3047457650,"text":"ううん、アタシが「塩の魔神」の歴史を研究しているのは、歴史が文化と信仰を教えてくれるからよ…","nextNodeIds":[110210620]},{"nodeId":110210620,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":55221762,"text":"あなたはお金のことしか考えてないみたいだけど！","nextNodeIds":[110210621]},{"nodeId":110210621,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":193017666,"text":"馬鹿言え！俺はスネージナヤの考古学研究員だ、正真正銘な！","nextNodeIds":[110210622,110210623]},{"nodeId":110210622,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":521693394,"text":"（考古学で儲けたいだけなのでは…）","nextNodeIds":[110210624]},{"nodeId":110210624,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":2679246882,"text":"そうだ、あのコップは売らない方がいいぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110210625]},{"nodeId":110210625,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1562938802,"text":"ん？なんでだ？","nextNodeIds":[110210626]},{"nodeId":110210626,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":4263407322,"text":"あれは凝光のコレクションで、群玉閣と共に落ちてきたんだ。七星を敵に回したくなければ…","nextNodeIds":[110210627]},{"nodeId":110210627,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":243629898,"text":"うっ…金になると思ったのに。","nextNodeIds":[110210628]},{"nodeId":110210628,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10303,"speakerName":"宛煙","textMapHash":4112530450,"text":"ほら、またお金の話！","nextNodeIds":[110210629]},{"nodeId":110210629,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":1308849010,"text":"だったらなんだっていうんだ！研究成果も金も、どっちも得るに越したことないじゃないか！","nextNodeIds":[110210630]},{"nodeId":110210630,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10302,"speakerName":"クリメント","textMapHash":960620026,"text":"さあ！ここは終わりにするぞ。そうだ「塩の魔神」、そいつには俺も興味があるんだ。次は「地中の塩」に行くか。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110210623,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1946055594,"text":"（魔神の力を集めたいだけでは…）","nextNodeIds":[110210624]},{"nodeId":110210608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","t